   .practice-icon::before {\n        font-size: 42px;\n      }\n\n      .practice p {\n        font-size: 17px;\n      }\n\n      .bottom-heading {\n        grid-template-columns: 82px 1fr;\n        gap: 15px;\n      }\n\n      .bottom-heading .orange-icon,\n      .orange-icon {\n        width: 82px;\n        height: 82px;\n      }\n\n      .bottom-heading .orange-icon .chart-mark {\n        transform: scale(.75);\n      }\n\n      .orange-icon .distance-mark {\n        transform: scale(.75);\n      }\n\n      .orange-icon .alert-mark {\n        transform: scale(.7);\n      }\n\n      .footer {\n        flex-direction: column;\n      }\n\n      .source {\n        font-size: 11px;\n        overflow-wrap: anywhere;\n      }\n\n      .visme {\n        align-self: flex-end;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <header class=\"header\">\n      <div class=\"arrow left\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n      <h1 class=\"header-title\"><span class=\"script\">Social</span> DISTANCING</h1>\n      <div class=\"arrow right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n    </header>\n\n    <section class=\"main-grid\">\n      <section class=\"left-column\">\n        <article class=\"section left-section\">\n          <div class=\"orange-icon placeholder\" aria-label=\"Distance icon\">\n            <div class=\"distance-mark\"></div>\n            <span class=\"placeholder-caption\">[Icon: horizontal distance arrows]</span>\n          </div>\n          <h2>WHAT IS SOCIAL<br>DISTANCING?</h2>\n          <p>\n            Social distancing, also called physical distancing, is a<br>\n            form of <strong>non-pharmaceutical intervention</strong>, which<br>\n            downtrends the spread of contagious diseases simply<br>\n            by <strong>keeping people “apart” from each other.</strong>\n          </p>\n        </article>\n\n        <article class=\"section left-section\">\n          <div class=\"orange-icon placeholder\" aria-label=\"Alert icon\">\n            <div class=\"alert-mark\"></div>\n            <span class=\"placeholder-caption\">[Icon: alert symbol]</span>\n          </div>\n          <h2>WHY IS SOCIAL<br>DISTANCING IMPORTANT?</h2>\n          <p>\n            It prevents <strong>contact between infected and uninfected<br>\n            individuals</strong>, resulting in reduced disease transmission<br>\n            and less deaths from fatal diseases.\n          </p>\n        </article>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"right-column\">\n        <article class=\"best-practices\">\n          <h2>BEST PRACTICES FOR<br>SOCIAL DISTANCING</h2>\n          <div class=\"practice-list\">\n            <div class=\"practice\">\n              <div class=\"practice-icon home placeholder\" aria-label=\"Home icon\">\n                <span class=\"placeholder-caption\">[Icon: home]</span>\n              </div>\n              <p><strong>Self/Home Quarantine: Stay home.</strong> Only go out<br>\n                if it’s very essential, that too with protection<br>\n                (gloves, masks, sanitizers)</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"practice\">\n              <div class=\"practice-icon people placeholder\" aria-label=\"People icon\">\n                <span class=\"placeholder-caption\">[Icon: group of people]</span>\n              </div>\n              <p><strong>Avoid public gatherings</strong> as much as possible</p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"practice\">\n              <div class=\"practice-icon shop placeholder\" aria-label=\"Shop icon\">\n                <span class=\"placeholder-caption\">[Icon: storefront]</span>\n              </div>\n              <p>\n                Keep spots susceptible to mass gatherings<br>\n                like <strong>parks, malls, food courts, restaurants<br>\n                and schools closed.</strong> Restaurants can be<br>\n                instructed to follow a “Takeaway” only<br>\n                system until the situation relaxes\n              </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"practice\">\n              <div class=\"practice-icon distance placeholder\" aria-label=\"Distance icon\">\n                <span class=\"placeholder-caption\">[Icon: horizontal distance arrows]</span>\n              </div>\n              <p>\n                Maintain a distance of <strong>at least 1 - 2 meters<br>\n                (3 to 6 feet) from other individuals</strong>\n              </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"practice\">\n              <div class=\"practice-icon hands placeholder\" aria-label=\"Handshake icon\">\n                <span class=\"placeholder-caption\">[Icon: handshake]</span>\n              </div>\n              <p><strong>Avoid shaking hands</strong> and embracing one another</p>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n      </section>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"bottom-section\">\n      <div class=\"bottom-heading\">\n        <div class=\"orange-icon placeholder\" aria-label=\"Chart icon\">\n          <div class=\"chart-mark\"></div>\n          <span class=\"placeholder-caption\">[Icon: line chart]</span>\n        </div>\n        <h2>SOCIAL DISTANCING IN THE TIME<br>OF COVID-19: FLATTENING THE CURVE</h2>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bottom-copy\">\n        <p>\n          For a disease like COVID-19, which spreads through air droplets from sneezing and coughing, scientists have claimed<br>\n          that <strong>social distancing might “flatten the curve”.</strong>\n        </p>\n        <p>\n          This means that if proper social distancing protocols are followed, the spread of the disease will <strong>slow down and<br>\n          relieve health care professionals and medical centers</strong> of the burden of providing aid to hundreds of patients at a<br>\n          time, which is not feasible.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <footer class=\"footer\">\n      <div class=\"source\">\n